 "inference": [
  "Aim-Guided Shell: the asset's own Damage 125 gives EA's 1.3.1.0 figures (235 to 625, 700) and the registry default 130 gives EA's 1.3.3.0 figures (244 to 650, 720). The registry default is the newer value and the one in use; the own value is the previous patch's number.",
  "Glaive: its direct-hit material 651 has grid value 0 against all three targets, so all vehicle damage comes from the blast: registry BlastDamage 155 x 3 = 465, x 6.5 = 1007.5, x 10 = 1550 (shown as 1000). The own value 125 would give 375 and 812.5, which EA does not state.",
  "Because the Glaive's damage is blast only, no hit-quality step applies, which is why EA gives one tank number and why it matches EA's statement that lock-on weapons ignore zones and angles.",
  "EA prints 1007.5 for helicopters, so only the jet figure is capped at 1000 in EA's notes."
 ],
 "unresolved": [
  "Current build values. Test: one Glaive hit on a full-health tank should remove 465 of 1200; three hits should destroy it.",
